dotnet-upgrade-scan

This project continues ideas from tools the community lost:
- Microsoft .NET Upgrade Assistant (MIT, deprecated) — extension architecture concepts.
- AWS Porting Assistant for .NET (Apache-2.0, closed to new customers) — assessment
  concepts. Rule data derived from aws/porting-assistant-dotnet-datastore will carry
  per-file provenance and this notice per Apache-2.0 §4.

No source code from these projects is included in this repository unless explicitly
marked with its origin and license.
